  "title": "Air Station Kodiak medevacs man 200 miles from Cold Bay, Alaska",
  "description": "A Coast Guard MH-60 Jayhawk rescue helicopter crew medevaced a 53-year-old man suffering cardiac issues from the motor vessel Maersk Eindhoven 200 miles south of Cold Bay, Alaska, November 16, 2017. The man was hoisted and taken to Cold Bay where a LifeMed aircraft crew was waiting for further transfer to higher medical care in Anchorage, Alaska. Video courtesy of Coast Guard Air Station Kodiak.",
